    <question_explanation no="13" id="PRB-72CBF0D74EBB7952-Q13">
      <question_stem>단상전압 $v ( t ) = \sqrt{2} V_{0} \sin \omega t$ [V]를 하나의 SCR를 이용하여 점호각 $\alpha = 60$ °로 위상제어할 때, 저항부하에 공급되는 평균 전압[V]은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>v ( t )</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\frac{3}{2 \sqrt{2} \pi} V_{0}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 전기기기 · SCR 위상제어의 평균 전압
정답은 ①이다. 단상 반파 위상제어의 평균전압은 Vavg = (Vm/2π)(1 + cosα)이다. Vm = √2V0, α = 60°이므로 Vavg = (√2V0/2π)(1.5) = 3V0/(2√2π)이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\frac{3}{2 \sqrt{2} \pi} V_{0}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>3V0/(2√2π)이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{\sqrt{2}}{\pi} V_{0}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>α = 0°인 반파 정류값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{3}{\sqrt{2} \pi} V_{0}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>2배 큰 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\frac{2 \sqrt{2}}{\pi} V_{0}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>전파 정류값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
